Profanity is allowed on Darkwind.  It is allowed on channels, 
tells, says, emotes, etc.

If you do not wish to hear profanity, turn "virginears on"
(this is on when your character is created by default.

NOTE: While profanity will be tolerated, personal attacks,
racial or ethnic slurs, and other forms of attack directed
at a player or a group of people (either online or offline)
will *NOT* be tolerated.  Abuse of this rule will be
punishable.

See also: virginears, rules
